# Half-Life MP5. Measured by vrcardgen, finished by hand.
#
# One moving part: bone "clip", the magazine, 10.14 units straight down Z in
# `reload`. Nothing else on this model moves - there is no bolt and no
# charging handle, which is the content ceiling the plan's mesh surgery
# (E-02) exists to break and names the MP5 as its first target.
#
# Two consequences, both stated below rather than worked around:
#
#   chamber_on_seat  - with no bolt to work, seating a magazine has to be
#                      what chambers a round. This flag is exactly the
#                      concession the plan describes, and mesh surgery
#                      retires it.
#   no_slide_lock    - the slide stop would engage on an empty magazine and
#                      then nothing could ever release it, because the joint
#                      a hand would grab does not exist on this model. A gun
#                      that locks itself open forever is worse than one that
#                      does not lock open at all.

weapon v_9mmar
match  bones 54  seqs 8  hash 0xefec1a61

type   magazine_slide  capacity 50  rpm 900
feed   chamber_on_seat  no_slide_lock
fire   semi auto  rpm 900

joint 1  bone "clip"  slide  travel 10.14  rest 0
    grab  point 7.20 9.89 4.02  radius 3.0
